{"sha": "15d8ce070d2b0b93f70fb28fafd6a1423837c83f1181acfe735b61277f0cdf5a", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g11:trigo} 章 --- 三角函数：单位圆}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:trigo:1}", "化为弧度：$30^\\circ = \\frac{\\pi}{6}$，$45^\\circ = \\frac{\\pi}{4}$，", "$120^\\circ = \\frac{2\\pi}{3}$, $270^\\circ = \\frac{3\\pi}{2}$.", "", "化为角度：$\\frac{\\pi}{5} = 36^\\circ$，$\\frac{5\\pi}{6} = 150^\\circ$，", "$\\frac{7\\pi}{4} = 315^\\circ$, $\\frac{2\\pi}{9} = 40^\\circ$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:trigo:2}", "$\\frac{2\\pi}{3}$ 与 $-\\frac{\\pi}{4}$ 已在", "$\\intoc{-\\pi}{\\pi}$ 内：分别位于第二象限和第四象限。", "", "$\\frac{17\\pi}{6} - 2\\pi = \\frac{5\\pi}{6}$：位于第二象限，靠近", "负 $x$ 轴。", "", "$-\\frac{7\\pi}{2} + 4\\pi = \\frac{\\pi}{2}$：位于单位圆顶端，", "$(0, 1)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:trigo:3}", "$\\cos\\frac{3\\pi}{4} = \\cos\\left(\\pi - \\frac\\pi4\\right)", "= -\\cos\\frac\\pi4 = -\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}$.", "", "$\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{6} = \\sin\\left(\\pi - \\frac\\pi6\\right)", "= \\sin\\frac\\pi6 = \\frac12$.", "", "$\\cos\\left(-\\frac\\pi3\\right) = \\cos\\frac\\pi3 = \\frac12$.", "", "$\\sin\\frac{4\\pi}{3} = \\sin\\left(\\pi + \\frac\\pi3\\right)", "= -\\sin\\frac\\pi3 = -\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$.", "", "$\\cos\\frac{11\\pi}{6} = \\cos\\left(-\\frac\\pi6 + 2\\pi\\right)", "= \\cos\\frac\\pi6 = \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:trigo:4}", "$\\sin^2 t = 1 - \\cos^2 t = 1 - \\frac{25}{169} = \\frac{144}{169}$，于是", "$\\sin t = \\pm\\frac{12}{13}$。在 $\\intoo{-\\frac\\pi2}{0}$ 内（第四象限）", "纵坐标为负，故 $\\sin t = -\\frac{12}{13}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:trigo:5}", "由 \\cref{prop:g11:trigo:associated} 得：", "\\[", "A = (-\\cos x) + \\cos x + \\cos x - \\cos x = 0 ,", "\\]", "\\[", "B = \\sin x + (-\\sin x) + (-\\sin x) = -\\sin x .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:trigo:6}", "$\\cos t = \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$：一个解为 $\\frac\\pi6$，故", "$t = \\pm\\frac\\pi6$（$2k\\pi$ 的其他平移均超出该区间）。", "", "$\\sin t = \\frac12$：$t = \\frac\\pi6$ 或 $t = \\pi - \\frac\\pi6 =", "\\frac{5\\pi}{6}$.", "", "$\\cos t = -1$：横坐标为 $-1$ 的点只有 $M(\\pi)$，故 $t = \\pi$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:trigo:7}", "$\\sin t = -\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$：由 $a = -\\frac\\pi3$，两族解分别为", "$-\\frac\\pi3 + 2k\\pi$ 与 $\\pi + \\frac\\pi3 + 2k\\pi$；在", "$\\intco{0}{2\\pi}$ 内：$t = \\frac{4\\pi}{3}$ 与 $t = \\frac{5\\pi}{3}$。", "", "$\\cos t = 0$：$t = \\frac\\pi2$ 与 $t = \\frac{3\\pi}{2}$。", "", "$2\\sin t + 1 = 0$ 即 $\\sin t = -\\frac12$：由 $a = -\\frac\\pi6$，在", "$\\intco{0}{2\\pi}$ 内：$t = \\frac{7\\pi}{6}$ 与 $t = \\frac{11\\pi}{6}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:trigo:8}", "由 \\cref{thm:g11:trigo:equations} 可知，$\\cos 2t = \\cos t$ 等价于", "$2t = t + 2k\\pi$ 或 $2t = -t + 2k\\pi$，即 $t = 2k\\pi$ 或", "$t = \\frac{2k\\pi}{3}$（$k \\in \\Z$）。第一族包含于", "第二族中（取 $k$ 为 $3$ 的倍数），因此解集为", "\\[", "S = \\left\\{\\frac{2k\\pi}{3} : k \\in \\Z\\right\\}", "\\]", "--- 即单位圆上的三个点 $M(0)$，", "$M\\!\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\right)$, $M\\!\\left(\\frac{4\\pi}{3}\\right)$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:trigo:9}", "展开两个平方并利用 $\\cos^2 x + \\sin^2 x = 1$：", "\\[", "(\\cos^2 x + 2\\sin x\\cos x + \\sin^2 x)", "+ (\\cos^2 x - 2\\sin x\\cos x + \\sin^2 x)", "= 1 + 1 = 2 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:trigo:10}", "无滑动滚动是指弧长等于", "行进的距离，即 $r\\theta = 150$ cm，由此得", "$\\theta = \\frac{150}{30} = 5$ 弧度 $= 5 \\times \\frac{180}{\\pi} \\approx", "286.5^\\circ$。车轮转一整圈，车子前进的圆周长", "$2\\pi \\times 30 = 60\\pi \\approx 188.5$ cm，约 $1.88$ m。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:trigo:11}", "在单位圆上，横坐标恰为 $\\frac12$ 的点为", "$M\\!\\left(\\pm\\frac\\pi3\\right)$。横坐标\\emph{不超过}", "$\\frac12$ 的点构成竖直直线 $x = \\frac12$ 左侧的弧，", "当 $t$ 从 $\\frac\\pi3$ 增至 $\\pi$，或从 $-\\pi$ 增至", "$-\\frac\\pi3$ 时所经过的弧。因此，在 $\\intoc{-\\pi}{\\pi}$ 上：", "\\[", "S = \\intoc{-\\pi}{-\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\cup \\intcc{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}{\\pi}.", "\\]", "（因不等式为非严格不等式，端点 $\\pm\\frac\\pi3$ 均包含在内。）", "\\end{solution}", ""]}